# OPFS (the SQLite storage) needs a cross-origin isolated page. These must be on EVERY file,
# including the worker script and wasm. Netlify and Cloudflare Pages read this file as-is.
# The rest: no MIME sniffing, no URLs leaked to other sites, and no framing (stops click-jacking the delete buttons).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
